<div
  class="
    flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-8
    group
  "
>
  <div class="flex-1 space-y-2">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <h4 class="font-black text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 tracking-tight">Excluir Conta Permanentemente</h4>
      <span
        class="
          animate-pulse px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-500/20 text-[9px]
          font-black text-red-600 uppercase tracking-tighter
        "
      >Irreversível</span>
    </div>
    <p
      class="
        text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed
      "
    >
      Ao confirmar, todos os seus
      <span class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-bold">decks, flashcards e estatísticas</span>
      serão incinerados. Não há backup para esta ação.
    </p>
  </div>

  <button
    command="show-modal"
    commandfor="dialog"
    class="
      w-full lg:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-red-500 hover:bg-red-600 text-white rounded-2xl
      font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[11px] transition-all duration-300
      shadow-lg shadow-red-500/20 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center
      gap-2
    "
  >
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">no_accounts</span>
    Encerrar Conta
  </button>
</div>

<el-dialog>
  <dialog
    id="dialog"
    aria-labelledby="dialog-title"
    class="
      fixed inset-0 size-auto max-h-none max-w-none overflow-y-auto bg-transparent
      backdrop:bg-transparent
    "
  >
    <%# Backdrop com desfoque premium %>
    <el-dialog-backdrop
      class="
        fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-md transition-opacity
        data-closed:opacity-0 data-enter:duration-300 data-enter:ease-out
        data-leave:duration-200 data-leave:ease-in
      "
    ></el-dialog-backdrop>

    <div
      tabindex="0"
      class="
        flex min-h-full items-end justify-center p-4 text-center focus:outline-none
        sm:items-center sm:p-0
      "
    >
      <el-dialog-panel
        class="
          relative transform overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-white dark:bg-slate-900
          text-left shadow-2xl transition-all data-closed:translate-y-4
          data-closed:opacity-0 data-enter:duration-300 data-enter:ease-out
          data-leave:duration-200 data-leave:ease-in sm:my-8 sm:w-full sm:max-w-lg
          data-closed:sm:translate-y-0 data-closed:sm:scale-95 border border-slate-200
          dark:border-slate-800
        "
      >
        <%# Header do Modal %>
        <div class="px-8 pt-8 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div
            class="
              size-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-500/10 flex items-center
              justify-center text-red-500
            "
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined font-bold">warning</span>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            command="close"
            commandfor="dialog"
            class="
              text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 dark:hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors
            "
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 pt-6">
          <h3
            id="dialog-title"
            class="
              text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter mb-2
            "
          >
            Você tem certeza absoluta?
          </h3>
          <p
            class="
              text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed
            "
          >
            Esta é a última etapa. Se você prosseguir, sua jornada no Elephanto
            chegará ao fim e todos os dados serão deletados dos nossos
            servidores.
          </p>

          <%= render "settings/delete_account_form", user: current_user %>
        </div>
      </el-dialog-panel>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</el-dialog>
